	(text "TPS621256YFFR -> C130070 = 3.1v to 5.0v, about 900mA  (Uses 1uH inductor)\nFAN48610UC50X -> C890712 = 3.1v to 5.0v, about 1A (Uses 470nH inductor)\n\n1uH inductor-> C315718\n470uH inductor -> C52741370\n\nFAN48610 appears to run cooler.  Recommend FAN48610"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 187.706 47.752 0)
		(effects
